OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo 10 said the first ministers of Wales
OL,8,Fand Scotland, and the first and deputy
OL,9,Ffirst ministers of Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fwill meet the prime minister at the
OL,11,FNational Economic Council in October.
